---
title: How to Download an Invoice?
sidebar:
  order: 5
---
**To duplicate a quotation:**

1. **Go to the “Invoices” section:**

   - **On the left sidebar, click on “Invoices” to view the list of Invoices.**

1. **Select the Invoice to download:**

   - **Find the Invoice you wish to download from the list.**
   - **Click the ellipsis menu (…) next to the Invoice.**

1. **Download the Invoice:**

   - **In the dropdown menu, click on “Download Invoice.”.**
   - **A duplicate of the selected Invoice will be created, and you can then edit or send the duplicated Invoice as needed.**

*invoice download*

**Alternatively, you can also access the “Download Invoice” option within the Invoice details page under the “Save Invoice” dropdown.**
